      "writtenOn": "2023-08-30T17:49:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You still need to call isOk() on the returned `res`. Otherwise, if the object is dead or the binder transaction fails for any reason, the service restarts.\n\nPerhaps:\n\n```\nauto res \u003d callback-\u003ehealthInfoChanged(health_info);\nif (!res.isOk()) {\n    LOG(WARNING) \u003c\u003c \"Cannot call healthInfoChanged on callback: \" \u003c\u003c ret.getDescription(); // and some other codes, etc.\n}\n// b/296817256: Not deleting the callback even on failed transactions.\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 281,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 281,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "41c586fff4591d75ce26a0e1d77579f55a29cdbe",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
