      "writtenOn": "2023-09-01T14:35:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry that I don\u0027t understand why not using a variable to store the ret value would cause the process to crash(or service restart). Doesn\u0027t this operation just ignore status? Regardless of whether the status is OK or not?\n```\ncallback-\u003ehealthInfoChanged(health_info);\n```\nThe only possiblity that service restart I could think of is ScopedAStatus destructor, but I found nothing  related in it. So could you please give more hints? Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "27262958_303ab612",
      "range": {
